ned**: Recognize that overreliance on brand strength without sufficient fundamentals can be risky; maintain a disciplined approach to valuation and market signals.  In summary, I am recommending a cautious stance due to the core risks highlighted by the bear side, aligning with lessons from past mistakes where I overlooked fundamental vulnerabilities in seemingly strong companies.
